toxins, which mutates virtually all sea life found throughout the ocean. Shortly there after, the boiling hot seas begin spewing heat resilient Wyrm tainted sea creatures who then proceed to the coast lines and begin eating everything that grows, thus serving as life force tentacles for the Wyrm which harvests through them on the souls of humankind.<br /> <br /> A titanic battle rages in which the forces of Gaia, including almost all of the shifters, many mages, and more importantly the Incarna and Celestin's that are aligned with it, physically incarnate on earth in an attempt to shut the worm down and or try to manipulate things from afar by altering the course of the battle through their own magic down from their local realms.<br /> <br /> The battle results in the death of most of humankind as Wyrm tainted creatures, fomori, basically ravage the Earth en mass. All of the vampire antediluvian's wake up at the same time and run amok basically, needing massive amounts of blood. Nephandi and black spiral dancers cause havoc wherever they can.<br /> <br /> The whole thing is a cluster fuck apocalypse of epic proportions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3148,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","user":"Zennis","date":". 02-12-2023, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}